WEBVTT

00:25.480 --> 00:32.040
THE 9TH PROFESSIONAL
FUNERAL TECHNIQUE COMPETITION

00:32.119 --> 00:33.560
JUDGE

00:43.920 --> 00:45.160
An embalmer

00:45.240 --> 00:47.440
pours their emotions into their craft

00:47.520 --> 00:50.320
and preserves culture with customs.

00:51.040 --> 00:53.160
They help the dead rest in peace

00:53.240 --> 00:55.400
and bring comfort to the living.

00:55.960 --> 00:57.200
Silently,

00:57.280 --> 00:58.880
they pass on the value of life.

00:58.960 --> 01:03.720
AUDITORIUM, CIVIL AFFAIRS
VOCATIONAL AND TECHNICAL COLLEGE

01:06.240 --> 01:08.920
Every life arrives in this world

01:09.000 --> 01:10.800
with its own cries.

01:10.880 --> 01:12.800
They are cleaned gently

01:12.880 --> 01:15.280
by their parents or nurses,

01:15.360 --> 01:18.000
completing the baptism to welcome a life.

01:30.320 --> 01:31.520
So when a life

01:31.600 --> 01:33.200
bids farewell to this world

01:33.280 --> 01:35.200
amidst the cries of others,

01:35.280 --> 01:37.240
they should be given

01:37.320 --> 01:38.960
a baptism of farewell.

01:39.040 --> 01:44.600
JUDGE

03:18.920 --> 03:23.680
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

03:26.760 --> 03:32.280
SHANGHAI YAKANG HOSPITAL

03:32.360 --> 03:34.480
-Your earrings are very pretty.
-Okay, it's yours.

03:35.480 --> 03:38.480
-How about the e-mail to Lisa?
-Don't worry, I've sent it. Be good.

03:38.560 --> 03:40.080
Ma, what are you eating?

03:40.160 --> 03:41.680
Why did I even give you the enzymes?

03:42.160 --> 03:43.000
Director Liu,

03:43.480 --> 03:44.800
are you back from training?

03:44.880 --> 03:46.200
Thank you for your hard work.

03:46.280 --> 03:48.360
-Can you please stop?
-Zhuang Jie?

03:48.440 --> 03:50.040
It's minor surgery. Minimally invasive.

03:50.960 --> 03:52.280
Qin!

03:52.360 --> 03:53.600
You will meet Colin next week.

03:53.680 --> 03:54.800
Show him the Equipment Dept.

03:54.880 --> 03:56.200
Don't ignore my calls again.

03:56.280 --> 03:58.000
After today, I won't have my gallbladder.

03:58.080 --> 03:59.680
Please do it for me!

04:04.200 --> 04:06.040
Why are you still acting
like a tough gangster?

04:06.120 --> 04:07.680
It's not easy to get hospitalized.

04:07.760 --> 04:09.960
Which medical salesperson
doesn't want to enter Yakang?

04:10.040 --> 04:11.560
My illness is a blessing in disguise.

04:11.640 --> 04:13.680
You're almost the top player
in the wellness industry.

04:13.760 --> 04:14.760
Aren't you satisfied yet?

04:14.840 --> 04:15.760
Stop flattering me.

04:15.840 --> 04:18.040
Are you jealous of me
since you're my competitor

04:18.120 --> 04:19.440
for top sales every year?

04:19.519 --> 04:21.680
Okay, you are good.

04:21.760 --> 04:24.280
When you're in the operating room,
just keep blabbering.

04:24.360 --> 04:27.920
You're right. I heard that my surgeon
is the hospital's vice president.

04:28.000 --> 04:28.840
Let me think.

04:28.920 --> 04:30.760
How can I leave a good impression later?

04:30.840 --> 04:31.960
Great.

04:32.040 --> 04:32.920
Just lie down.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.920
Overall, there is no problem

04:47.000 --> 04:48.640
with the operational process just now.

04:56.880 --> 04:59.200
Just be aware
of your body position and gait.

04:59.760 --> 05:01.000
When standing,

05:01.080 --> 05:03.640
your two feet should be
in a T-shape or a figure-eight shape

05:03.720 --> 05:05.160
to move forward and backward freely

05:05.240 --> 05:06.480
and turn to the side swiftly.

05:07.720 --> 05:09.440
Before bathing,

05:09.520 --> 05:11.600
check every area of the skin carefully.

05:11.680 --> 05:13.480
Some tiny wounds

05:13.560 --> 05:15.800
need to be cleared, disinfected,

05:15.880 --> 05:17.240
and closed in advance.

05:17.840 --> 05:18.880
In addition,

05:19.960 --> 05:21.360
don't rush through washing their hair.

05:41.960 --> 05:43.680
From the sideburns to the Baihui acupoint.

05:47.400 --> 05:49.000
From the Shenting to the Baihui acupoint.

05:52.760 --> 05:54.200
From the Wangu to the Baihui acupoint.

05:54.840 --> 05:56.280
Repeat several times.

05:58.440 --> 05:59.960
Sink in your chest and hunch your back.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.760
Do not stick out your chest and belly.

06:01.840 --> 06:03.480
This will help you
to control your strength

06:03.560 --> 06:04.760
and allow you to work longer.

06:13.760 --> 06:15.040
After death,

06:15.760 --> 06:17.280
one's pores will become loose

06:17.360 --> 06:18.800
and hair will fall out more easily.

06:19.600 --> 06:21.400
So be careful of how much force you exert.

06:32.440 --> 06:34.920
Some family members will choose
to watch the ceremony on-site.

06:35.880 --> 06:37.680
So every move you make

06:38.880 --> 06:40.840
will affect their feelings.

07:05.000 --> 07:05.840
Everyone,

07:07.160 --> 07:10.080
facing death is never a simple thing.

07:10.880 --> 07:12.240
A long time ago,

07:12.880 --> 07:15.240
our work was considered dirty,

07:15.320 --> 07:17.040
vile, and despicable.

07:18.520 --> 07:19.920
Even today,

07:20.760 --> 07:23.760
no one would be willing
to stay too long at where we work.

07:24.840 --> 07:26.440
After saying, "Thank you,"

07:27.160 --> 07:29.040
no one would say, "See you again."

07:30.600 --> 07:32.280
However, I hope you understand

07:33.720 --> 07:35.560
that we are not the ones they hate

07:37.840 --> 07:39.040
but death.

07:50.560 --> 07:51.880
NEXT STATION, NANPING NORTH

08:14.640 --> 08:16.920
Excuse me. Thank you.

08:17.760 --> 08:18.720
Thanks.

08:19.280 --> 08:20.480
Thanks.

08:42.880 --> 08:44.039
Are you from Nanping?

09:09.520 --> 09:10.480
Is something the matter?

09:16.360 --> 09:18.000
Don't you remember me?

09:18.080 --> 09:19.400
We know each other.

09:31.960 --> 09:32.840
Excuse me.

09:45.440 --> 09:46.760
Was that necessary?

09:46.840 --> 09:48.760
We really do know each other.

10:17.040 --> 10:17.920
Chen Maidong.

10:18.600 --> 10:19.880
You really are a piece of work.

10:22.000 --> 10:23.440
I am Zhuang Jie.

10:23.520 --> 10:25.240
We were high school classmates.

10:25.320 --> 10:26.680
Have I changed that much?

10:28.160 --> 10:29.080
Yes.

10:29.920 --> 10:31.880
Okay, I'll take it as a compliment.

10:31.960 --> 10:33.240
You've changed a lot too.

10:33.320 --> 10:36.560
I was only sure that it was you
after seeing the scar on your forehead.

10:36.640 --> 10:37.480
Sorry,

10:38.280 --> 10:39.720
I don't recall your special features.

10:40.960 --> 10:42.920
Me? Do I not have any?

10:44.040 --> 10:44.960
Sorry.

10:45.520 --> 10:46.800
I really didn't recognize you.

10:49.280 --> 10:51.120
I have something to do. I'm leaving.

10:53.480 --> 10:56.000
Did you think I was hitting you up?

10:56.600 --> 10:57.880
Yes.

10:57.960 --> 11:00.280
So is this how you would respond
to a girl hitting you up?

11:00.360 --> 11:01.200
Yes.

11:01.280 --> 11:03.320
Are you driving? Give me a ride.

11:03.400 --> 11:04.520
Yes,

11:04.600 --> 11:05.880
but I'm busy.

11:05.960 --> 11:06.880
Take a taxi.

11:11.040 --> 11:12.080
Whatever.

11:25.360 --> 11:31.520
ALL WILL BE WELL
WHEN PEOPLE AND FAMILY ARE IN HARMONY

11:36.320 --> 11:37.280
Come on.

11:46.600 --> 11:47.680
Mr. He!

11:47.760 --> 11:49.400
You're back, Jie.

11:49.960 --> 11:51.640
Why didn't you tell us
that you were coming?

11:51.720 --> 11:53.200
I could've picked you up. Allow me.

11:53.280 --> 11:54.920
-It's okay. Taxis are convenient.
-Let me.

11:55.000 --> 11:55.920
I'll get you some food.

11:56.000 --> 11:57.520
No, let's have dinner together tonight.

11:57.600 --> 11:59.320
I'm going to surprise my mom later.

11:59.400 --> 12:00.240
Okay.

12:00.320 --> 12:01.160
Come.

12:03.080 --> 12:04.320
Gosh!

12:04.840 --> 12:06.920
Why has the house become like this?

12:07.000 --> 12:09.600
I'm burning the midnight oil every night
with He Niaoniao.

12:09.680 --> 12:11.080
Her grades are terrible.

12:11.160 --> 12:12.720
I can't bear to look at it.

12:15.640 --> 12:18.400
Has my mom
improved her braised chicken recipe?

12:19.880 --> 12:21.240
What's this?

12:21.760 --> 12:23.800
There is a kite competition
in the town this autumn.

12:23.880 --> 12:26.000
I'm trying to improve
my kite-making skills.

12:26.600 --> 12:27.440
How does it look?

12:27.520 --> 12:28.960
You just like to keep yourself busy.

12:29.040 --> 12:31.560
It must be hard on you
to go to bed early and get up early.

12:32.320 --> 12:33.440
It's not hard on me.

12:33.520 --> 12:35.120
Your mom has it worse.

12:35.200 --> 12:36.480
Let me tell you.

12:36.560 --> 12:37.520
Last night,

12:37.600 --> 12:40.200
your mom was almost
about to crack open He Niaoniao's skull.

12:40.280 --> 12:41.720
She said she wanted to see her brains

12:41.800 --> 12:43.880
and how they are different
from yours and Zhuang Yan's.

12:44.840 --> 12:48.040
Well, isn't having me
as her dad the only difference

12:48.120 --> 12:50.240
that He Niaoniao has
from you and your brother?

12:50.320 --> 12:52.280
-Since I was a kid, my grades have been--
-Mr. He.

12:52.360 --> 12:53.800
Stop making excuses for He Niaoniao.

12:53.880 --> 12:56.360
Her mind is sharp.
She's just using it on the wrong things.

12:56.440 --> 12:57.600
Let me deal with her.

13:29.160 --> 13:34.160
FUNERAL VEHICLE

13:41.720 --> 13:43.680
Master!

13:43.760 --> 13:45.120
You are finally back.

13:45.200 --> 13:46.920
Something always happens when you're away.

13:47.000 --> 13:49.120
-What's wrong?
-Hurry inside and take a look.

13:53.520 --> 13:54.680
This way.

13:54.760 --> 13:58.000
GOOD BEGINNING AND GOOD ENDING,
WITH THE UTMOST TRUTH AND SINCERITY

13:58.680 --> 14:00.720
Who has hidden my buddy?

14:00.800 --> 14:02.760
The deceased passed away
while they were drinking.

14:02.840 --> 14:05.360
All your brothers are here,
yet you left by yourself!

14:05.440 --> 14:07.600
-Quiet down!
-That's how the drunkards came here.

14:07.680 --> 14:10.200
Huang, come out quickly!

14:10.280 --> 14:11.480
Let's call the police.

14:11.560 --> 14:12.560
Come out, Huang!

14:12.640 --> 14:14.400
Huang!

14:14.480 --> 14:16.280
Are you friends with Huang too?

14:16.360 --> 14:17.440
We're ironclad brothers!

14:17.520 --> 14:18.680
-Who are you?
-Who?

14:18.760 --> 14:20.640
We just had a drink together.
Did you forget?

14:22.680 --> 14:24.280
-Then I'll have a drink with you.
-Sure.

14:24.360 --> 14:25.720
Let's go. Let's drink together.

14:25.800 --> 14:26.680
Brothers!

14:26.760 --> 14:28.080
There's more liquor, guys.

14:28.160 --> 14:29.600
Let's go!

14:29.680 --> 14:30.600
There is liquor.

14:30.680 --> 14:32.680
-There's liquor.
-Come. Come here to drink.

14:33.240 --> 14:34.440
I'm going to buy you drinks.

14:34.520 --> 14:37.160
-I'll buy you drinks. Wait for a moment.
-Okay, go and buy drinks.

14:37.240 --> 14:38.200
-Is that everyone?
-Yes.

14:38.280 --> 14:39.800
Five men are as strong as fifty men.

14:39.880 --> 14:41.040
Stop yapping. Stay here.

14:41.120 --> 14:43.240
Proceed with cremation.
Let them out when they sober up.

14:43.320 --> 14:44.480
Seriously, these guys.

14:44.560 --> 14:46.160
There's a time and place for drinking.

14:46.240 --> 14:47.120
They're troublemakers.

14:47.200 --> 14:49.360
Feng Xilun, I said to stop yapping.

14:49.440 --> 14:50.680
Come over here.

14:51.680 --> 14:53.200
Where's the liquor?

14:55.320 --> 14:57.400
Ever heard of the Battle of Antietam?

14:57.480 --> 14:58.560
No.

14:58.640 --> 15:01.320
It had the highest daily casualties
among the American civil wars.

15:01.960 --> 15:03.200
Before clearing the battlefield,

15:03.280 --> 15:05.560
the regiment commander
specifically requested his superiors

15:05.640 --> 15:07.160
to allow the soldiers to drink liquor

15:07.240 --> 15:09.000
before burying the bodies
of their companions.

15:09.080 --> 15:10.560
For some people,

15:10.640 --> 15:12.440
they need alcohol to numb them

15:12.520 --> 15:14.120
in order to complete some special tasks.

15:16.720 --> 15:19.600
Even drunkards have the right to be sad.

15:20.360 --> 15:21.760
If we called the police,

15:21.840 --> 15:23.040
they would sober up

15:23.120 --> 15:24.440
in the detention center.

15:25.760 --> 15:27.640
In the future,
whenever they miss their friend,

15:27.720 --> 15:29.600
they would be reminded
of their poor behavior.

15:29.680 --> 15:30.800
That would double their pain.

15:32.240 --> 15:33.320
I understand, Master.

15:33.400 --> 15:34.240
I was wrong.

15:36.160 --> 15:38.200
Pour them some tea. Look after them.

15:38.280 --> 15:42.040
Okay. When they sober up,
I will take them to send off their friend.

15:57.120 --> 15:58.360
Something funny is happening

15:58.440 --> 15:59.960
at the town committee today.

16:00.040 --> 16:02.200
Indeed. How did Wu Xuehua
meet such an opponent?

16:02.280 --> 16:03.720
Yes, they were hard to deal with.

16:03.800 --> 16:04.640
Madam Wu?

16:07.440 --> 16:09.720
Madam Wu,
you have been beaten so many times.

16:09.800 --> 16:11.720
-Excuse me.
-Why can't you return a single ball?

16:11.800 --> 16:12.680
That's right.

16:12.760 --> 16:14.560
They really have her beat.

16:14.640 --> 16:16.920
The opponent obviously came prepared.

16:17.000 --> 16:18.880
Even if you were to go,
you would be beaten.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.120
I really don't believe it.

16:20.200 --> 16:21.560
Hurry up.

16:21.640 --> 16:22.720
I'm coming.

16:24.720 --> 16:25.640
Come.

16:25.720 --> 16:27.400
SCIENTIFIC FITNESS FOR THE SAKE
OF OUR NATION'S WONDERFUL LIFE

16:27.480 --> 16:28.600
Come here.

16:33.920 --> 16:34.840
Come again.

16:34.920 --> 16:36.760
Come on!

16:43.960 --> 16:45.840
Mr. Wang, your turn.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.640
Come on!

16:53.720 --> 16:56.320
-Come on.
-You've got this.

16:56.400 --> 16:57.240
Play well, Mr. Wang.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.840
Wipe your sweat.

16:58.920 --> 17:00.320
Good luck!

17:00.400 --> 17:02.000
That's enough. We're playing ping pong.

17:02.080 --> 17:03.920
Why are you making it sound
like we're boxing?

17:18.200 --> 17:19.800
Come. You two, come at me together.

17:19.880 --> 17:21.440
-Bring it on.
-Go, all the best.

17:21.520 --> 17:23.240
-Come on, good luck.
-Go!

17:23.319 --> 17:24.640
-Fight well, come on.
-Come on.

17:24.720 --> 17:25.920
-You must win. Go.
-Come on.

17:27.400 --> 17:28.920
Come on!

17:59.400 --> 18:00.520
Another miss.

18:04.160 --> 18:05.840
Why didn't you receive it?

18:07.120 --> 18:08.680
-Awesome.
-Incredible.

18:10.280 --> 18:12.280
Madam Wu, let's keep going.

18:13.160 --> 18:14.280
Mrs. Chen,

18:14.360 --> 18:16.400
I know you are a professional.

18:16.480 --> 18:19.000
You shouldn't bully us like this.

18:19.080 --> 18:21.360
Are you not advocating
for national fitness?

18:21.440 --> 18:23.960
Well, I am the director
of the local Women's Federation.

18:24.040 --> 18:26.640
Well, I can't be playing
ping pong here all day.

18:26.720 --> 18:29.000
From my observations,
you are horsing around every day.

18:29.080 --> 18:31.040
That's why I am training you.

18:31.120 --> 18:33.920
Madam Wu, what activity are you hosting?

18:37.000 --> 18:38.760
Jie? When did you come back?

18:38.840 --> 18:40.080
I didn't hear it from your mom.

18:40.160 --> 18:42.160
I had the impulse
to come back for a vacation.

18:42.240 --> 18:43.560
It's good to see you back.

18:43.640 --> 18:45.160
Stay longer this time.

18:45.240 --> 18:46.200
Let me tell you.

18:46.280 --> 18:48.160
Our town is now changing every day.

18:48.240 --> 18:50.240
You won't get bored anytime soon,

18:50.320 --> 18:51.320
all right?

18:51.400 --> 18:53.320
Where are you going?
The match isn't over yet.

18:54.520 --> 18:55.360
Come.

18:56.000 --> 18:57.840
Help me. I beg you.

18:57.920 --> 18:59.240
I can't.

18:59.320 --> 19:00.360
You can. Come on.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.200
Ready, go!

19:07.800 --> 19:08.920
-Great.
-This…

19:09.000 --> 19:09.920
This is…

19:11.360 --> 19:13.200
Is there no one else
on the town committee?

19:13.280 --> 19:15.760
You try to fool me with some amateurs.

19:15.840 --> 19:18.120
Mark my words.

19:18.600 --> 19:21.680
If you don't solve
my grandson's marriage problem,

19:21.760 --> 19:23.320
no one can leave today.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.440
My grandson

19:25.520 --> 19:27.520
is a great person

19:27.600 --> 19:28.880
and a pillar of the country.

19:28.960 --> 19:31.720
He is the most indispensable talent
in our town.

19:31.800 --> 19:33.400
If even he can't find a partner,

19:33.480 --> 19:35.200
what's the use of your department?

19:36.360 --> 19:37.200
Madam Wu,

19:37.280 --> 19:40.000
is this grandma trying
to find a wife for her grandson?

19:40.080 --> 19:42.280
Yes, she comes often.

19:42.360 --> 19:44.000
She has almost driven me crazy.

19:45.440 --> 19:47.200
Madam Wu, let me see

19:47.280 --> 19:48.200
if I can help you.

19:48.280 --> 19:49.480
Good girl.

19:54.320 --> 19:55.280
Ma'am,

19:56.280 --> 19:57.880
I am a layman when it comes to ping pong,

19:57.960 --> 19:59.760
but I am good at finding a partner.

20:11.040 --> 20:11.960
Girl,

20:12.720 --> 20:14.920
if you are a spy sent by Wu Xuehua,

20:15.000 --> 20:16.120
I won't spare you.

20:16.200 --> 20:17.640
Ma'am,

20:18.360 --> 20:20.480
is there no more trust between people?

20:20.560 --> 20:21.840
Do I look like a traitor?

20:25.160 --> 20:27.480
All right, then tell me.

20:27.560 --> 20:28.560
What's your plan?

20:28.640 --> 20:31.240
These days, arranged marriages
by parents or matchmakers

20:31.320 --> 20:32.640
are no longer popular.

20:32.720 --> 20:35.200
The best place to find a partner
is at a gathering with friends

20:35.280 --> 20:36.720
while eating and drinking.

20:36.800 --> 20:37.960
You don't say!

20:38.040 --> 20:39.240
My grandson isn't into that.

20:39.320 --> 20:41.520
What about dating websites?

20:41.600 --> 20:42.480
Social media?

20:42.560 --> 20:44.240
That's even more unreliable.

20:44.320 --> 20:46.160
We don't even know
who is on the other side yet,

20:46.240 --> 20:47.600
and they want to collect my money.

20:48.400 --> 20:49.960
You don't want to spend money either.

20:53.480 --> 20:54.480
Ma'am,

20:55.080 --> 20:56.600
have you heard of WeChat's Shake?

21:00.440 --> 21:02.000
Low cost, high opportunities.

21:02.080 --> 21:04.120
It's practically tailored
for your grandson.

21:06.480 --> 21:07.600
Look.

21:09.280 --> 21:10.240
DISCOVER, SHAKE

21:10.320 --> 21:11.440
SHAKE

21:11.520 --> 21:13.440
How do you shake this?

21:13.520 --> 21:14.560
Let me teach you.

21:17.840 --> 21:18.720
SHAKE

21:18.800 --> 21:19.960
SEARCHING FOR PEOPLE NEARBY

21:23.680 --> 21:24.720
XIAOLEI, 25KM AWAY

21:27.240 --> 21:29.160
Will a girl appear after shaking it?

21:29.240 --> 21:30.520
There will definitely be girls.

21:30.600 --> 21:31.880
You have to tirelessly

21:31.960 --> 21:33.440
shake, search, and chat.

21:34.960 --> 21:37.160
Not bad, girl.

21:37.240 --> 21:38.720
Although you have poor coordination,

21:38.800 --> 21:40.640
you have a sharp brain.

21:40.720 --> 21:43.080
Ma'am, as long as you
continue shaking diligently,

21:43.160 --> 21:45.240
I promise you'll get
a granddaughter-in-law this year.

21:46.960 --> 21:47.920
Teach me again.

21:48.560 --> 21:49.520
Look.

21:50.360 --> 21:51.960
Look for this page.

21:52.760 --> 21:54.640
Swipe to open and click into it.

21:54.720 --> 21:55.640
Hear the noise.

21:58.760 --> 21:59.920
RA?NI, 24KM AWAY

22:06.720 --> 22:07.920
Let me tell you again.

22:09.160 --> 22:10.000
Look for this page.

22:10.080 --> 22:11.640
Click this.

22:11.720 --> 22:13.280
After that, listen.

22:28.360 --> 22:31.320
LIAOGEN BRAISED CHICKEN

22:36.360 --> 22:37.400
Thank you.

22:38.560 --> 22:39.400
What would you like?

22:39.480 --> 22:41.040
-One chicken.
-One chicken.

22:41.120 --> 22:42.520
-Two drumsticks.
-Okay.

22:43.080 --> 22:44.920
-Two drumsticks.
-Yes.

22:50.320 --> 22:51.880
-Here you go.
-Thanks.

22:51.960 --> 22:53.720
-What would you like?
-A drumstick and a wing.

22:53.800 --> 22:55.840
A drumstick and a wing.

22:55.920 --> 22:57.600
Okay. Thank you.

22:58.120 --> 23:00.200
Okay. Hi, what would you like?

23:00.280 --> 23:01.440
I never eat chicken.

23:01.520 --> 23:03.200
Don't you sell anything else?

23:04.000 --> 23:04.960
You!

23:05.040 --> 23:07.200
What are you doing here?
Where did you come from?

23:07.280 --> 23:08.720
-Ma'am.
-You…

23:08.800 --> 23:10.080
I want a chicken and a drumstick.

23:10.160 --> 23:11.120
Okay.

23:11.200 --> 23:12.120
It's not the holidays.

23:12.200 --> 23:13.720
What made you come home suddenly?

23:14.320 --> 23:15.720
Were you fired?

23:15.800 --> 23:18.080
Can't you wish for something good for me?

23:18.640 --> 23:19.680
I had a dream.

23:19.760 --> 23:21.000
I dreamed that you missed me.

23:21.080 --> 23:23.360
I took my annual leave
to stay with you for a few days.

23:23.440 --> 23:26.560
As always, you are a sweet talker.

23:26.640 --> 23:28.120
Do you think I believe you?

23:28.200 --> 23:30.920
Mom, don't you miss me?

23:31.000 --> 23:32.040
Shoo!

23:32.120 --> 23:34.480
Don't disgust me here.

23:34.560 --> 23:36.280
When would I have time to miss you?

23:37.440 --> 23:38.840
We're closing the stall early today.

23:38.920 --> 23:40.400
I'll give you two drumsticks for free.

23:40.480 --> 23:41.400
It's a new flavor.

23:41.480 --> 23:42.560
Tell the folks about it.

23:53.200 --> 23:54.280
Grandma.

23:57.760 --> 23:58.840
Grandma.

24:13.880 --> 24:15.000
Grandma.

24:21.400 --> 24:23.200
-Thank you.
-Okay.

24:25.360 --> 24:26.960
I just passed by the town committee.

24:27.040 --> 24:28.640
I helped Madam Wu deal with a grandma

24:28.720 --> 24:30.440
who was looking for a date
for her grandson.

24:30.520 --> 24:32.640
I'm drained after talking my mouth off.

24:33.800 --> 24:37.440
Madam Wu really has a hard time
being the Women's Federation's director.

24:37.520 --> 24:39.120
Where do I put this?

24:39.200 --> 24:40.080
Let me do it.

24:40.160 --> 24:41.360
Let's hurry home. I'm hungry.

25:11.800 --> 25:14.680
EGG FLAVORED NOODLES

25:26.280 --> 25:27.800
Zhangyue, that's enough.

25:27.880 --> 25:29.400
There are so many dishes already.

25:29.480 --> 25:30.520
This is the last one.

25:31.000 --> 25:31.880
Here it comes.

25:31.960 --> 25:34.240
Your favorite shredded sweet potato.

25:34.320 --> 25:37.320
Mr. He, your cooking has improved.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.320
This is nothing.

25:38.400 --> 25:40.160
We would need your mom to make a feast.

25:41.480 --> 25:43.120
What time does Niaoniao get out of school?

25:44.400 --> 25:45.880
The time she gets out of school

25:45.960 --> 25:47.880
depends on how much detention she gets.

25:48.600 --> 25:50.880
It seems like you just can't stop
dissing your daughter.

25:50.960 --> 25:52.440
I diss her every day,

25:52.520 --> 25:54.120
but she still doesn't care at all.

25:54.200 --> 25:56.320
If I followed your method
of motivational education,

25:56.400 --> 25:57.600
she would drive me mad.

25:58.080 --> 25:58.960
She's back.

25:59.040 --> 26:01.600
You brat! Can't you be more careful?

26:01.680 --> 26:03.480
Do you want to break the door?

26:03.560 --> 26:05.640
-That's enough.
-I'm starving!

26:06.640 --> 26:07.800
Unbelievable.

26:13.360 --> 26:14.400
Jie!

26:15.640 --> 26:16.840
Let me take a look at you.

26:17.840 --> 26:18.840
You do look much fairer.

26:18.920 --> 26:20.440
The whitening mask works well, right?

26:20.520 --> 26:21.360
Yes.

26:21.440 --> 26:23.520
Why does she care about whitening?
She is still young.

26:23.600 --> 26:24.520
You are both mental.

26:24.600 --> 26:26.320
Niaoniao, quick, come over and eat.

26:27.160 --> 26:28.640
You scold me as soon as I come in.

26:28.720 --> 26:29.600
Do you see this?

26:29.680 --> 26:31.520
I'm not allowed to speak in this house.

26:32.120 --> 26:33.920
He Niaoniao, don't accuse me.

26:34.000 --> 26:36.160
Jie, take me to Shanghai quickly.

26:36.640 --> 26:38.440
Even if you go to Shanghai,

26:38.520 --> 26:40.600
you won't even be able
to read the hotel signs.

26:41.400 --> 26:43.120
Jie, look. She's always humiliating me.

26:43.200 --> 26:45.200
True, the way our mom talks
is quite problematic.

26:47.480 --> 26:48.520
Stop talking about me.

26:48.600 --> 26:50.080
I haven't asked you yet.

26:51.040 --> 26:53.040
Why did you suddenly take leave?

26:53.120 --> 26:54.160
Is the company doing badly?

26:54.240 --> 26:55.080
Remember this.

26:55.160 --> 26:57.720
Our company is among the top ten
medical device companies globally.

26:57.800 --> 26:59.560
Your daughter
is a senior technical sales rep.

26:59.640 --> 27:01.040
I can enjoy paid time off.

27:01.120 --> 27:02.760
So what if it's in the top ten
or top five?

27:02.840 --> 27:03.960
You don't own the company.

27:04.040 --> 27:06.200
You should pay more attention
to our family business.

27:06.280 --> 27:07.520
Didn't I applaud you every time

27:07.600 --> 27:08.960
you broke your sales record?

27:09.040 --> 27:10.840
Stop doing that nonsense.

27:11.600 --> 27:13.560
Listen, Mr. He and I

27:13.640 --> 27:16.040
plan to expand our business.

27:16.120 --> 27:17.640
No more slaughtering chickens at home.

27:17.720 --> 27:20.040
The blood smells bad
and it's not environmentally friendly.

27:20.120 --> 27:21.320
Coincidentally,

27:21.400 --> 27:22.560
you're back now.

27:22.640 --> 27:24.440
Starting tomorrow,
you will do the deliveries.

27:24.520 --> 27:26.880
This way, Mr. He will have time
to look for a factory with me.

27:28.160 --> 27:30.000
I'm here on vacation.

27:31.520 --> 27:33.160
Spoiled brat.

27:33.240 --> 27:34.440
Zhuang Jie, let me tell you,

27:34.520 --> 27:38.920
I don't care if you are called
Ashley or Jessica in Shanghai.

27:39.000 --> 27:40.080
When you're back home,

27:40.160 --> 27:41.840
you are my worker.

27:42.360 --> 27:43.200
She's right.

27:45.160 --> 27:47.760
This shredded sweet potato
is stuck in my teeth.

27:47.840 --> 27:50.080
Mom, just talk less.

28:03.960 --> 28:05.160
CLASSICAL MUSIC ARCHIVES

28:10.200 --> 28:12.840
POSSESSION ORGANIZER

29:22.760 --> 29:23.760
It's time for breakfast.

29:25.040 --> 29:27.760
Dad, I told you I don't like
the breakfast from this place.

29:27.840 --> 29:29.760
Can you show me some respect?

29:29.840 --> 29:31.760
I'll buy it from another store next time.

29:31.840 --> 29:33.960
I didn't buy this for you today.

29:35.000 --> 29:36.560
Fine, for my sister's sake.

29:37.640 --> 29:39.400
By the way, Dad,
don't leave in a hurry yet.

29:39.480 --> 29:40.760
About the sneakers…

29:40.840 --> 29:42.800
If you need money,
discuss it with your mom.

29:42.880 --> 29:44.080
Zhuang Jie.

29:44.160 --> 29:46.480
Zhuang Jie, don't laze around in bed.

29:46.560 --> 29:48.800
Tutor He Niaoniao on her homework later.

29:48.880 --> 29:49.960
Did you hear that?

29:50.640 --> 29:53.520
I haven't dared to reply
to her class's WeChat group.

29:53.600 --> 29:56.000
Also, don't forget
to do the deliveries this afternoon.

29:56.080 --> 29:58.600
Clean up your messy hair and dirty face
before going out.

29:58.680 --> 30:01.160
Don't affect
Liaogen Chicken's brand image.

30:01.240 --> 30:03.680
You're the same every day,
always sleeping in.

30:04.160 --> 30:05.000
Mom.

30:05.080 --> 30:07.160
I'm busy now. We can talk tonight.

30:07.240 --> 30:08.120
Mom!

30:34.680 --> 30:36.320
He Niaoniao, are you a monkey on a stick?

30:39.360 --> 30:42.120
Jie, I'm firmly on your side.

30:42.200 --> 30:43.720
Don't make an enemy out of me.

30:45.160 --> 30:47.400
Niaoniao, do you want
to make some extra cash?

30:53.480 --> 30:54.840
-Gentler.
-You don't have much hair.

30:54.920 --> 30:56.280
Why hire someone to wash it?

30:56.760 --> 30:58.560
We city people are like this.

31:01.120 --> 31:02.200
By the way, Jie,

31:02.280 --> 31:03.800
I forgot to mention

31:03.880 --> 31:05.920
that 30 is the price
for washing your hair.

31:06.000 --> 31:07.240
Scalp massage is 50.

31:07.320 --> 31:08.960
Shampoo and massage, 50 in total.

31:09.040 --> 31:09.880
Sixty.

31:09.960 --> 31:11.800
Deal, but it has to be
at least 15 minutes.

31:11.880 --> 31:12.720
Deal.

31:15.120 --> 31:16.480
Niaoniao,

31:16.560 --> 31:17.680
during my vacation here,

31:17.760 --> 31:18.880
I'll let you wash my hair.

31:18.960 --> 31:21.640
Why don't you take the money
and sign up for a cram school?

31:21.720 --> 31:23.720
I'll think about it.
My schedule is quite full too.

31:23.800 --> 31:25.800
I was planning
to watch a concert with the money.

31:25.880 --> 31:27.280
He Niaoniao, be serious.

31:27.360 --> 31:28.560
I've been there.

31:28.640 --> 31:30.640
You obviously changed the score
on your math paper.

31:30.720 --> 31:33.400
Mom might miss it, but you can't fool me.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.920
I won't tell her this,

31:35.000 --> 31:37.400
but you have to go to cram school
whether you want to or not.

31:46.760 --> 31:48.760
Jie, I forgot to mention it just now.

31:48.840 --> 31:50.960
The second basin of water is half-price.
It's 30 yuan.

31:51.040 --> 31:52.200
What?

31:52.280 --> 31:53.680
Do you want it?

31:53.760 --> 31:54.800
It's okay if you don't.

31:54.880 --> 31:55.760
Come back.

31:56.600 --> 31:57.920
You profiteer.

31:58.000 --> 31:59.640
That's who I am.

31:59.720 --> 32:01.760
I accept WeChat Pay but no late payments.

32:02.680 --> 32:03.560
Transfer it yourself.

32:07.920 --> 32:09.080
Don't transfer extra.

32:16.280 --> 32:18.440
Jie, just enjoy your vacation.

32:18.520 --> 32:19.720
Why are you Shaking?

32:19.800 --> 32:21.000
Who did I Shake?

32:21.080 --> 32:22.520
Here, someone is Shaking you here.

32:22.600 --> 32:23.800
They're called Old Cedar.

32:23.880 --> 32:25.080
She looks like a grandma.

32:26.640 --> 32:28.080
OLD CEDAR

32:30.840 --> 32:33.000
Sure, add her.

32:37.440 --> 32:39.760
Jie, you have to give me
another 100 yuan as hush money.

32:40.800 --> 32:42.560
He Niaoniao,
are you not ashamed of yourself?

32:42.640 --> 32:44.760
If you don't pay up, I'll tell our mom

32:44.840 --> 32:46.680
that you've been Shaking
like an indecent girl.

32:47.440 --> 32:49.960
He Niaoniao, give me my phone.

32:50.040 --> 32:51.080
No.

32:51.160 --> 32:53.080
He Niaoniao,
you aren't done washing my hair yet!

32:53.160 --> 32:54.240
Be self-reliant, Jie.

32:54.320 --> 32:55.760
-He Niaoniao!
-Hurry up on the deliveries.

32:55.840 --> 32:56.960
Or else, Mom will scold you.

33:00.880 --> 33:03.920
LIAOGEN BRAISED CHICKEN,
LIAOGEN SPECIAL FOOD

33:19.160 --> 33:23.240
TONGJIN GUANYIN PALACE OF SHUIMEN,
QUANJUN

34:49.639 --> 34:52.440
Don't mention 300,000.

34:52.520 --> 34:54.600
Even if it's three million,

34:54.679 --> 34:58.920
who will have the guts to stop me?

35:00.240 --> 35:01.080
You!

35:04.720 --> 35:05.720
You're finally here.

35:05.800 --> 35:07.160
We're having a gratitude dinner.

35:07.240 --> 35:09.040
We can't run out of food.

35:09.120 --> 35:10.840
Gratitude for what? It's quite lively.

35:10.920 --> 35:13.480
My dad's funeral was a few days ago.

35:13.560 --> 35:15.320
A lot of people were there to help.

35:15.400 --> 35:16.440
Sorry, I had no idea.

35:16.520 --> 35:17.760
Let me give you a discount.

35:17.840 --> 35:18.760
No need.

35:18.840 --> 35:20.840
He was 97. It was a joyful mourning.

35:20.920 --> 35:22.280
Congratulations then.

35:23.240 --> 35:24.400
I mean, you're blessed.

35:24.480 --> 35:26.080
I'll leave you to it. I'm leaving first.

35:26.160 --> 35:27.440
Why don't you grab a bite too?

35:27.520 --> 35:29.520
-No, thanks.
-Watch some opera then.

35:29.600 --> 35:31.000
The Han emperor Liu Bang…

35:31.080 --> 35:32.800
Think of it as a show of support.

35:32.880 --> 35:33.960
This is my gratitude dinner.

35:34.040 --> 35:35.000
Come on, sit here.

35:35.080 --> 35:36.880
I specially invited this troupe

35:36.960 --> 35:38.040
from the provincial capital.

35:38.120 --> 35:39.720
They're performing Farewell My Concubine.

35:39.800 --> 35:41.400
Keep watching. I need to get back to it.

35:41.480 --> 35:45.520
Just an ordinary man,

35:46.280 --> 35:49.400
yet you are someone

35:49.480 --> 35:51.000
who makes a woman

35:51.080 --> 35:54.600
fall in love.

35:56.560 --> 35:59.240
In this world

35:59.320 --> 36:03.120
full of desire and chaos,

36:03.760 --> 36:07.720
how could there be
such a sincere, straightforward,

36:07.800 --> 36:12.240
and deeply sentimental man like you?

36:13.600 --> 36:17.400
From that time on,

36:17.480 --> 36:20.040
you have been engraved

36:20.120 --> 36:23.560
in my heart.

36:23.640 --> 36:25.520
-Great!
-Excellent!

36:26.640 --> 36:29.080
Full of nonsense!

36:32.040 --> 36:34.440
Tell me. Is it Liu Bang?

36:34.520 --> 36:36.760
Did he send you to convince me?

36:38.000 --> 36:39.640
I was merely listening

36:39.720 --> 36:41.400
to the call of my heart.

36:41.480 --> 36:42.520
That Liu Bang

36:42.600 --> 36:46.120
is a scoundrel, a gangster.

36:46.200 --> 36:51.240
He dimmed the romantic night

36:51.320 --> 36:55.720
and disregarded the yin and yang

36:55.800 --> 36:58.160
between men and women.

37:08.760 --> 37:12.760
Listen to the four corners

37:16.560 --> 37:21.840
The song of Chu

37:24.320 --> 37:26.880
Tearing my heart apart

37:27.560 --> 37:31.520
Tearing my heart apart

37:39.320 --> 37:40.400
Chen Maidong.

37:47.080 --> 37:48.080
What a coincidence.

37:49.720 --> 37:50.840
Not really.

37:51.960 --> 37:53.280
I'm just here to have a meal.

37:54.240 --> 37:55.520
You aren't eating anything.

37:55.600 --> 37:57.480
Aren't you just watching
the love triangle?

38:04.680 --> 38:05.640
Well,

38:06.520 --> 38:08.120
you're sitting in my grandma's seat.

38:08.200 --> 38:09.360
Is it necessary

38:09.440 --> 38:10.360
to raise my seniority

38:10.440 --> 38:11.800
just to drive me away?

38:13.880 --> 38:14.960
What is it, girl?

38:15.040 --> 38:16.320
Do you want to be a grandma?

38:18.920 --> 38:20.040
It's you.

38:20.120 --> 38:21.760
The Shake girl.

38:29.760 --> 38:31.440
Is this your grandson?

41:05.080 --> 41:11.880
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
